{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "woman-in-the-dunes",
  "chunk_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-chunk-0565",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00565",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“怎么啦？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What is it?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00565",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "话开了头，别在半路上停下来！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Once you have started talking, do not stop halfway!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00565",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "你想用星星来算卦吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Are you trying to tell fortunes by the stars?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00565",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "还是这地方的迷信？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Or is it some local superstition?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00565",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "……难道没有星星的晚上绳梯不能放下吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Can it be that on a night without stars, the rope ladder cannot be lowered?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00565",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "……怎么回事，嗯，不说话可是什么也不知道啊！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What is going on? Well, if you do not speak, I cannot know anything!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00565",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "……是呵，要是一定得等到星星出来的话，那是你们的事……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I see. If you absolutely have to wait until the stars come out, that is your affair.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00565",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "可要是等的时候，刮起大风来打算怎么办呢……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But what do you plan to do if a strong wind starts blowing while you are waiting?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00565",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "那就不是星星所能引起的混乱。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That would not be confusion caused by the stars.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
